# Evidence-engine: the engine's inputs and intermediates (publications.csv,
# compounds, search log, abstracts) are restricted local build material and are
# never committed. The public artefacts are the numbers-only manifest
# data/processed/evidence_manifest.json and the AGGREGATE contract files under
# data/evidence/contract/ (publication IDs + tier counts only), which the daily
# sync-evidence workflow mirrors from api-service.
